    "answer": {
      "text": "Here is the information regarding the playable classes in *Diablo II: Lord of Destruction*, based on public sources like the official Blizzard wiki and Wikipedia.\n\n**Diablo II (Base Game) Classes:**\nThese four classes were available in the original 1997 release:\n1.  **Amazon**\n2.  **Necromancer**\n3.  **Paladin**\n4.  **Sorceress**\n\n**Diablo II: Lord of Destruction (Expansion) Classes:**\nThis expansion added exactly two new playable classes:\n1.  **Assassin**\n2.  **Druid**\n\n**Diablo II vs. Diablo III Distinction:**\nIt is important to note that *Diablo III* is a separate, later game (released in 2012) with its own distinct set of six classes (Barbarian, Wizard, Witch Doctor, Necromancer, Demon Hunter, Monk). The classes listed above apply strictly to the *Diablo II* universe.\n\n**Source Links:**\n*   [Diablo II: Lord of Destruction - Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diablo_II:_Lord_of_Destruction)\n*   [Diablo II Classes - Blizzard Wiki](https://us.diablo.fandom.com/wiki/Diablo_II_classes)",
